#. type: Title =
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/exercise4.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exercise 4"
msgstr "練習題 4"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/exercise4.adoc:6
msgid "In this exercise you will use the GBIF API to locate specific taxon keys."
msgstr "在此練習中，您將使用 GBIF API 來查找特定的分類群檢索。"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/exercise4.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Taxon keys* are issued at the species, genus family, order, phylum and kingdom rank. \n"
msgstr "*分類群檢索* 依物種、屬、科、目、門及界等分類階層排序。 \n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/exercise4.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Unique identifiers* are issued to accepted names with synonyms of those accepted names issued the same identifier.  Usage keys vs acceptedUsageKeys.\n"
msgstr "*唯一識別碼* 會發給已接受的學名，而這些已接受的學名的同物異名則會被賦予相同的識別碼。 使用檢索與已接受使用檢索的區別。\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/exercise4.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Taxon keys allow for user to ensure that they are collecting all the data they need.\n"
msgstr "分類群檢索可協助使用者確保已蒐集到全部所需資料。\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/exercise4.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Taxon keys also facilitate multiple species downloads.\n"
msgstr "分類群檢索也有助於下載多個物種的資料。\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/exercise4.adoc:13
msgid "Taxon keys can be found via:"
msgstr "可透過以下方式查閱分類群檢索："

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/exercise4.adoc:15
msgid "https://www.gbif.org/[GBIF.org]"
msgstr "https://www.gbif.org/[GBIF.org]"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/exercise4.adoc:16
msgid "https://techdocs.gbif.org/en/openapi/v1/species[Species API^]"
msgstr "https://techdocs.gbif.org/en/openapi/v1/species[物種 API^]"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/exercise4.adoc:17
msgid "https://www.gbif.org/tools/species-lookup[Species matching tool^]"
msgstr "https://www.gbif.org/tools/species-lookup[物種比對工具^]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/exercise4.adoc:22
msgid "xref:attachment$Ex4-species-api.docx[Download Exercise 4] (MS Word 158 KB)."
msgstr "xref:attachment$Ex4-species-api.docx[下載練習題 4] (MS Word 158 KB)."

